{"id": "1792831375317-0", "correlation_id": 25, "at": "2026-10-24T08:42:55.316869Z", "status": "success", "name": "result", "data": {"reply": "On official data, a 25 m\u00b2 studio costs about \u20ac372\u2013392/month in rent alone in the four Rouen-area communes with figures, so all fit a \u20ac600 budget, though the official data does not separate Rouen Centre or Rive Gauche.\n\nDeliverables:\n1. results.csv: rent per m\u00b2 by area (2025, official Carte des loyers for 1\u20132 room flats) and the computed 25 m\u00b2 rent.\n2. analysis.md: method, table, sources, caveats, and the chart (rent_per_m2_chart.png is in the sandbox at /home/cominty/work/rouen-rents/).\n\nKey caveats:\n- The official figures are for 1\u20132 room flats, not studios specifically.\n- Figures are rent only; charges and utilities are not included, so check total monthly cost.\n- The differences between communes are small (under \u20ac1/m\u00b2), so they do not justify a firm ranking.", "files": [{"id": "4QjTNx01DDgE", "name": "results.csv", "mimetype": "text/csv"}, {"id": "oc6sT2fhj24V", "name": "analysis.md", "mimetype": "text/markdown"}], "questions": [], "metadata": null, "cost": {"failed": false, "input_tokens": 1144293, "cached_tokens": 1015271, "output_tokens": 21410, "input_cost": "0.026958760", "output_cost": "0.0107911", "total": "0.037749860"}}}
